  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Complementary food production (CHAI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To significantly reduce stunting in young children by supporting the production, distribution and up take of quality complementary foods. The improvements are projected to save more than 225,000 lives over 4 years. These results would significantly contribute to DFID&apos;s global nutrition target to reach 20 million pregnant women and children under 5 through nutrition programmes.</narrative>
  </description>
